 "message": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff; padding:14px; border-radius:6px;max-width:520px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #102a43;\">Your Visitor Has Arrived</h3>\n<p>Hi {{ doc.host_name or doc.person_to_visit }}, your visitor <b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">{{ doc.visitor_full_name }}</b> has checked in at the gate and is now on their way to meet you.</p>\n\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0;table-layout:fixed;\">\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Visitor</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.visitor_full_name }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Company</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.company__organisation or 'N/A' }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Type</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.visitor_type }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Badge</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.badge_number or 'Digital QR pass (no physical badge)' }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;width:40%;\"><b style=\"color:#5b6b7b;\">Purpose</b></td><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f2;word-break:break-word;\">{{ doc.purpose_of_visit }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 2px; border-bottom:1px solid #edf0f